{"ok":true,"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00044","versions":[{"version_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00044@rel:R25-11#51af7b75","canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00044","release":"R25-11","content":"function GetValue [SWS_PER_00044] Upstream: RS_PER_00003 , RS_PER_00010 , RS_AP_00119 , RS_AP_00120 , RS_ AP_00121, RS_AP_00127 , RS_AP_00128 , RS_AP_00129 , RS_AP_00135 , RS_AP_00136 , RS_AP_00139 , RS_AP_00141 , RS_AP_00159 template &lt;class T&gt; ara::core::Result &lt; void &gt; GetValue ( ara::core::StringView key, T &amp;value) const noexcept; Returns the value assigned to a key of this KeyValueStorage. This method should only be used to access very large values repeatedly. GetValue may be delayed by an ongoing call from another thread to RemoveAllKeys or Discard PendingChanges, or to SetValue, RemoveKey, RecoverKey, or ResetKey for the same key-value pair. This method uses transaction semantics, it sees the current state of transaction, not the actual physical storage. Header-Datei #include \"ara/per/key_value_storage.h\" class mono Scope class ara::per::KeyValueStorage class mono Exception-Sicherheit exception safe class mono Thread-Sicherheit thread-safe PerErrc ::kKeyNotFound rollback_semantics class mono Template-Parameter th Parameter th Beschreibung td T td The type of the value that shall be retrieved. Parameter (in) th Parameter th Beschreibung td key td The key to look up. Parameter (out) th Parameter th Beschreibung td value td The retrieved value. Rückgabewert th Typ th Beschreibung td ara::core::Result &lt; void &gt; td A Result of void. In case of an error, it contains any of the errors defined below, or a vendor specific error. Fehler th Fehlercode th Beschreibung td Returned if the provided key does not exist in the Key-Value td Storage. td td PerErrc ::kPhysicalStorageFailure td rollback_semantics Returned if access to the physical storage fails. td PerErrc ::kIntegrityCorrupted td rollback_semantics Returned if stored data cannot be read because the structural integrity is corrupted. td PerErrc ::kValidationFailed td rollback_semantics Returned if the validity of stored data cannot be ensured. td PerErrc ::kEncryptionFailed td rollback_semantics Returned if the decryption of stored data fails. td PerErrc ::kDataTypeMismatch td rollback_semantics Returned if the data type of stored value does not match the templated type. td PerErrc ::kAuthenticationFailed td rollback_semantics Returned if checking the MAC of stored data fails.","meta":{"trigger_kind":"baseline_sync"},"recorded_at":"2026-09-30T16:43:34+00:00"}],"lifecycle":{"canonical_id":"AUTOSAR/AP/record/SWS_PER_00044","is_dropped":false,"first_active_release":"R25-11","last_active_release":"R25-11","dropped_in":[],"first_dropped_release":null,"absent_before":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11"],"platform_releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"latest_platform_release":"R25-11"},"element":{"kind":"function","name":"GetValue","module":"PER","cluster":"","page":"classes/cl_ara_per_KeyValueStorage_e55123.html","doc_type":"SWS","ai":false,"first":"R25-11","last":"R25-11","changed":[],"distinct":1},"evidence":{"figures":[{"id":"FIG-b045d30e3c97fa76","doc":"AUTOSAR_AP_EXP_SWArchitecture","p":90,"rel":[],"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"GetValue API in KeyValueStorage","n":16,"cap":"Figure 9.36: Interfaces for key-value-based data storage","sha":"b045d30e3c97fa76804aee0624930cbac3f6a04b3d15be2ecbb043d7043e46b6","nser":5,"src":"figure"},{"id":"FIG-4927e742d5d704e8","doc":"AUTOSAR_AP_EXP_SWArchitecture","p":228,"rel":[],"role":"heuristic","conf":0.9,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"GetValue service specification","n":4,"cap":"Figure 11.11: Scenario: Read Persistent Data with Unique ID","sha":"4927e742d5d704e80e1af113bfbbde8baa7281473972ad43d8110370ba50c549","nser":3,"src":"figure"},{"id":"FIG-67a0c9934f8b513a","doc":"AUTOSAR_AP_EXP_SWArchitecture",